{
  "name": "01 · Lead Finder (Kaamchor AI · MAP 2.0 · Sales)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 🔎 Lead Finder – Google Maps → personal first line\nEvery morning: search Google Maps for businesses → open each website → Claude writes a personal first line for your cold email → new row in Google Sheets.\n\n**Setup (10 min)**\n1. **Your search**: set the search (e.g. `dentist in Austin TX`), how many results, and one line about what you sell.\n2. **Google Maps search**: in Google Cloud enable *Places API (New)*, create a key and paste it in the empty `X-Goog-Api-Key` header (or use a Header Auth credential).\n3. **Claude**: add your Anthropic API key credential.\n4. **Save to Google Sheet**: connect Google Sheets, make a sheet with headers: Date, Business, Website, Rating, Reviews, Address, Maps link, Observation, First line, Fit score, then pick it.\n5. Execute once, check the sheet, then Activate.\n\nNothing is emailed. You review the lines first.\n\n---\nPart of **MAP – 12 AI agents** (Kaamchor AI).",
        "height": 380,
        "width": 560,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "f177a707-fd83-44ff-a768-453313e948ba",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -320,
        -260
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "triggerAtHour": 8
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "3cb8ccf8-0136-489d-ad15-fa508faf9d1f",
      "name": "Every morning 8 AM",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "6a8c87ea-2109-4f57-9de6-d123d00201ba",
              "name": "search",
              "value": "dentist in Austin TX",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "bc697be3-1f8d-4190-b9c2-c474b51fef15",
              "name": "max_results",
              "value": 10,
              "type": "number"
            },
            {
              "id": "d98b7c00-c596-4362-a152-8f890178e5bd",
              "name": "my_offer",
              "value": "We build AI receptionists that answer every call and WhatsApp and book appointments 24/7.",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "2516c9eb-630c-41ca-8081-558c2dac147d",
      "name": "Your search",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        220,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://places.googleapis.com/v1/places:searchText",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "X-Goog-Api-Key",
              "value": ""
            },
            {
              "name": "X-Goog-FieldMask",
              "value": "places.displayName,places.websiteUri,places.rating,places.userRatingCount,places.formattedAddress,places.googleMapsUri"
            }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ textQuery: $json.search, pageSize: $json.max_results }) }}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "7771a4a5-e371-4697-9fbd-364f3c30278f",
      "name": "Google Maps search",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        440,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "return ($input.first().json.places || [])\n  .filter(p => p.websiteUri)\n  .map(p => ({ json: { business: p.displayName?.text, website: p.websiteUri, rating: p.rating, reviews: p.userRatingCount, address: p.formattedAddress, maps: p.googleMapsUri } }));"
      },
      "id": "6b3fc888-4007-4a13-99da-68fbb34464d2",
      "name": "One row per business",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        660,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "url": "={{ $json.website }}",
        "options": {
          "response": {
            "response": {
              "neverError": true,
              "responseFormat": "text"
            }
          },
          "timeout": 15000
        }
      },
      "id": "b966bcf4-6b0e-41dc-b396-fb9b1935e595",
      "name": "Check website",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        880,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "return $input.all().map((item, i) => {\n  const biz = $('One row per business').all()[i].json;\n  const html = String(item.json.data || '');\n  const title = (html.match(/<title[^>]*>([^<]*)/i) || [])[1] || '';\n  const text = html.replace(/<script[\\s\\S]*?<\\/script>|<style[\\s\\S]*?<\\/style>/gi, ' ').replace(/<[^>]+>/g, ' ').replace(/\\s+/g, ' ').trim().slice(0, 2500);\n  const signals = { online_booking: /book (online|now)|appointment/i.test(html), chat_widget: /intercom|tawk|crisp|livechat|whatsapp/i.test(html) };\n  return { json: { ...biz, title, text, signals } };\n});"
      },
      "id": "f9708323-de0a-45fa-8146-115411773f18",
      "name": "Website notes",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        1100,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=You write the first line of a cold email. It must prove we really looked at this business.\n\nWHAT WE SELL: {{ $('Your search').first().json.my_offer }}\n\nBUSINESS: {{ $json.business }} ({{ $json.rating }}★ from {{ $json.reviews }} Google reviews, {{ $json.address }})\nWEBSITE TITLE: {{ $json.title }}\nSIGNALS: {{ JSON.stringify($json.signals) }}\nWEBSITE TEXT:\n{{ $json.text }}\n\nReturn: one specific observation from their site or reviews, a first line (max 25 words, friendly, no flattery, no 'I hope this finds you well'), and a fit score 1-10 for how much they need what we sell.",
        "hasOutputParser": true
      },
      "id": "90599a4a-d6ac-4151-a71d-8bac135882c1",
